msgid "{PRINTABLE_BOOKLET_SIZE} puzzles across {PRINTABLE_BOOKLET_PAGE_COUNT} pages, printed {PRINTABLE_BOOKLET_PUZZLES_PER_PAGE} to a page with the solved grids at the back."
