msgid "Solving Easy boards without reaching for a hidden single? Step back to <0>Newbie Sudoku</0>, or step up to <1>Medium Sudoku</1>, where intersections and your first pairs appear. Prefer paper? Download the <2>printable Easy sudoku booklet</2>, or see the <3>sudoku for seniors</3> guide for large-print and comfort options. See the full <4>technique index</4>, the <5>how to play</5> guide, or every tier on the <6>Sudoku difficulty levels</6> hub back <7>home</7>."
